{"id":"679d440fc68b","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/useful-links","lang":"en","title":"Useful links","description":"","section":"Innovation","crumbs":["Innovation","Innovate","USI Transfer","About"],"image":null,"words":132,"alternates":{"it":"/it/innovazione/innovare/usi-transfer/su-di-noi/link-utili","en":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/useful-links"},"breadcrumb":[{"label":"Home","path":"/en"},{"label":"Innovation","path":"/en/originalnode/23939"},{"label":"Innovate","path":"/en/originalnode/23935"},{"label":"USI Transfer","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer"},{"label":"About","path":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/mission"},{"label":"Useful links","path":null}],"blocks":[{"t":"quote","name":"Innosuisse","role":"","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/usitransfer-logo-innosuisse.png","html":"<p>Innosuisse is the Swiss Innovation Agency. Its role is to promote science-based innovation in the interest of the economy and society in Switzerland.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.innosuisse.admin.ch/en\">For more information</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"ARAMIS","role":"","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/usitransfer-aramis-logo-transfer.jpg","html":"<p>The ARAMIS database contains information regarding research projects and evaluations that are run or funded by the Confederation itself.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.aramis.admin.ch/\">For more information</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"swiTT","role":"","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/usitransfer-switt-logo-transfer_1.jpg","html":"<p>The Swiss Technology Transfer association is the association of professionals who are active in the transfer of technology from institutes of public research and education, university hospitals, and other not-for-profit research organizations to the private sector in Switzerland.</p> <p><a href=\"https://switt.ch/\">For more information</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"Swiss Federal Institute of Intellectual Property / Istituto Federale della Proprietà Intellettuale","role":"","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/usitransfer-ige-logo-transfer_4.jpg","html":"<p>The Swiss Confederation's Centre of competence for patent, design and trade mark protection, indication of source and copyright.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.ige.ch/en/\">For more information</a></p>"},{"t":"quote","name":"WIPO","role":"","photo":"https://www.usi.ch/sites/default/files/storage/images/usitransfer-wipo-logo-640x640_0.jpg","html":"<p>The World Intellectual Property Organization (WIPO) is the global forum for intellectual property (IP) policy, services, information and cooperation.</p> <p><a href=\"https://www.wipo.int/portal/en/\">For more information</a></p>"}],"ctas":[],"nav":[{"label":"USI Transfer","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer"},{"label":"Mission","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/mission"},{"label":"Team","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/team"},{"label":"Intellectual Property","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/intellectual-property"},{"label":"Success Stories","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/success-stories"},{"label":"Useful Links","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/useful-links"},{"label":"Contact","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/contact"},{"label":"Licensing Opportunities","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/licensing-opportunities"},{"label":"Industrial Agreements","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/industrial-agreements"},{"label":"Collaborate with us","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/industry/partners-innovation"},{"label":"Support","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/support"},{"label":"Grant Support","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/grant-support"},{"label":"Documents","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/researchers/documents"},{"label":"For Startups","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/startup"},{"label":"News on Technology Transfer","href":"/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/news"}],"links":[],"source":"https://www.usi.ch/en/innovation/innovate/usi-transfer/about/useful-links","fetchedAt":"2026-10-08T18:01:02.464Z"}